   "date": "2017-09-08T07:58:39Z",
   "subject": "What's the item remove standard based on h2?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Call</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df_core</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df_core_mirt_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;graded&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    method </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MHRM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Full</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">information item factor analysis </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">).</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Converged</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> within </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tolerance after </span><span style=\"color:#066\">69</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> MHRM iterations</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mirt version</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.24</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>M</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">step optimizer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NR1</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>I will get the result like:</div><div><div>q02 0.0000 0.000 0.672 0.000 0.000 0.45192</div><div>q03 0.0000 0.000 0.000 0.000 0.373 0.13939</div><div>q04 0.2339 0.000 0.000 0.000 0.000 0.05470</div></div><div> The h2 value is 0.45192,0.13939,0.05470.</div><div>item should be removed if h2 is low, What&#39;s the experimental standard?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
